Package: phostor
Title: An App That Adds Stories to Photos!
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("George", "Ostrouchov", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "go@tennessee.edu")
Description: Records stories for a collection of photos in a directory - a perfect
    app to bring photos to life with your family, friends, and relatives.
    A Shiny app shows the folder tree of a read-only photo directory, displays
    any photo on a click, and captures the conversation about it as audio.
    Every visit to a photo writes its own sidecar beside that photo's record --
    audio, the names the room supplied, and the place, event and date they
    settled on -- so revisiting a photo adds to its history. The route through
    the photos is logged as it happens, and
    a Play button replays the whole sitting: the same photos, in the same
    order, with the same voices. The photo directory is never written to.
